~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

if State.rang == true:
	Phone: Boss is calling again...
else:e
	Phone: Boss is calling...
- Answer
	Boss: Listen carefully, Milton.
	Boss: There’s a green car waiting for you at the end of the road.
	Boss: It'll bring you to my warehouse so you can get a blade from there.
	Boss: You are obligated to take care of someone who has betrayed me.
	Boss: His name is Mr. Floyd.
	Boss: Betray me, and I'll send someone to bring you both.
	set State.finished_dialogue = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	=> END
- Decline
	set State.rang = true
	=> start

set State.finished_dialogue = true
set State.in_dialogue = false
=> END
